  "review": {
    "gallery": "Nine visually matched developer renders from the official 28-page brochure. The aerial hero/card gives tower and location context, with day elevation and amenity scenes available in the gallery.",
    "location": "Brochure physical page 4 names JVT District 4 and contains the schematic and published travel table. The conflicting Mitchell’s listing district is qualified. The website map searches by project name. The ambiguous combined Ibn and Dubai Festival City label is omitted.",
    "floorPlans": "Eight official apartment layouts and the printed area panels from physical pages 24 and 26. Paired sheets preserve the original disclaimer blocks. The 101 Properties engineering mirror corroborates the twelve retail numbers. Mitchell’s retail brochure supplies all twelve individual sheets and the ground-floor overview. Retail 02’s heading says convenience/service but its table says F&B. No category is assigned to it in the selector. Published areas and precision are retained."
  },
